# The inputs of the pre-suite step whose title slugs to this directory name, in the inputs.decl grammar the fixtures use
# (.githooks/pre-push, ps_flush). A directory is keyed by its listing and every file under it, so a path added to it moves the key.
# Each top-level directory the step read is declared whole; the hook file is declared because it holds the step command and its flags.
.githooks/pre-push
core/
docs/
scripts/
